- React Select (option list rendering without memoization causes perf drops at scale)
- Stripe integration via @stripe/react-stripe-js and @stripe/stripe-js (async operations must not block main thread)
- Heavy lodash usage: lodash.* utilities are imported separately throughout codebase (module overhead compounds with multiple imports per file)
