- Jest testing framework configured in jest.config.js; pretest phases run `npm run build:config`

Common perf traps in this stack to prioritize:
1. Multiple lodash.* imports in a single component file (cumulative overhead from bundling many small utilities)
2. React Hook Form watch() or validation callbacks causing full CheckoutPage re-renders on every keystroke
3. React Select opening/closing without memoized option elements
4. Sequential async/await chains in form submission or email validation instead of Promise.all
5. Stripe async operations (tokenization, validation) blocking form interaction
6. Missing email validation optimization—case-insensitive comparisons running character-by-character on every keystroke
7. Checkout page layout shifts during validation feedback rendering

